{"DEMAND_ITEMS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heh - you're brave - or stupid - which is it?","You want my stuff? Take it, if you can","Ha! Hahaha, you're robbing ME? Funniest thing I've heard all week","You got me, take the cigarettes and the bullets, but leave the knife, it was my dad's","You've got guts, kid, I'll give you that, take it, but we'll meet again","Easy, easy, here, take the stupid pack, damn, you're serious about this"}},
