{"DEMAND_ITEMS","st=neutral",{"Careful, people get shot over less"}},
{"DEMAND_ITEMS","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"You're robbing ME? Oh, that's rich, that's the funniest thing I've heard all week","Hand it over? {g:Pal|Lady}, I'm the one who robs people, you've got the wrong guy","Nice try, kid, I've been taking from folks since you were in diapers","You've got guts, I'll give you that, stupid guts, but guts","Give you my stuff? The answer is no, and you're about to learn why"}},
{"DEMAND_ITEMS","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You want my stuff? COME GET IT!","Rob ME?! You're dead, DEAD!","Try it and I'll bury you in your own shallow grave!","Hahaha! You're robbing us? Boys! Boys, come look! We're getting robbed!","Last fool who tried to take my pack is still hanging off the overpass on 31W - want to go visit?"},false,{[5]="GENERIC"}},
