{"DEMAND_ITEMS","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"You want my stuff? Take it from my cold dead hands!","Rob me? You're a dead {g:man|woman}!"}},
{"DEMAND_ITEMS","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Robbing a patch? That's a new one on me","You've got a lot of nerve, I'll say that for you"}},
