{"DEMAND_ITEMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Take it- take it- TAKE IT- just don't hurt me!!","Oh God, oh God, here, here, it's all yours, ALL of it!","Pleeease, pleeease, leave me something, a little, a LITTLE..","Why, why, WHY?! I already lost everything!!","Okay!! Okay, take it, take everything, just don't hurt me, I'll give you whatever, whatever you want!!","Please, I've got kids, they need that, please, take half, take- oh God, take it all, just go","I- I have a can of beans and a flashlight, that's all, that's ALL, I- it's true, it's all I have","Here, it's yours, all of it, I'm not fighting you, don't hurt me, please...","You're robbing me?! Now?! I've lost everything already, everything, what else do you want from me?!","Take it, shit, take it all, just don't touch me","I haven't eaten since yesterday, please leave me a little, anything, a cracker...","Okay, just let me put the bag down, slowly, see? slowly, don't shoot me"}},
